@startuml
title Conquista - Diagrama de Implantacao (arquitetura planejada)
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false

node "Dispositivo do usuario" <<device>> as device {
  node "Navegador" <<executionEnvironment>> as browser {
    artifact "SPA React + TypeScript\nVite: frontend/dist" as spa
  }
}
node "Vercel\nPLANEJADO" <<executionEnvironment>> as vercel {
  artifact "Build estatico React/Vite\nrotas SPA via vercel.json" as web
}
node "Render\nPLANEJADO" <<executionEnvironment>> as render {
  artifact "FastAPI\nUvicorn + proxy headers" as api
  artifact "Alembic CLI\nupgrade controlado, fora do start" as alembic
}
database "Neon\nPLANEJADO" <<executionEnvironment>> as neon {
  artifact "PostgreSQL\nDATABASE_URL com TLS" as db
}
node "Provedor SMTP configurado\nPLANEJADO / opcional" <<executionEnvironment>> as mail {
  artifact "SMTP autenticado\nSTARTTLS ou SSL" as smtp
}
browser --> vercel : HTTPS / SPA
browser --> api : HTTPS / JSON / Bearer JWT
api --> db : PostgreSQL TLS\nDATABASE_URL
api --> smtp : SMTP autenticado\nativacao, notificacoes
alembic ..> db : conexao TLS\naprovacao e execucao manual
note bottom of vercel
  Vercel, Render, Neon e SMTP sao destinos de implantacao planejados.
  Nenhuma URL publica foi verificada; este diagrama nao declara deploy concluido.
end note
@enduml
